      "sourceTextSha256": "26bc660faaec7b47e9151d4b9ade6334dbb912d0e467c0e684498daad0b364b2",
      "text": "Day 3 · Breakfast. Today we take a boat to visit two of the twelve villages that surround this beautiful lake. We will get to know the Tz'utujil town of San Juan La Laguna, known for the harmony with which its residents live alongside nature and culture. We continue on to Santiago Atitlán, a town inhabited by Tz'utujil Maya who live from fishing and handicrafts, though best known as devotees of a Maya-Catholic deity they call Maximón. Overnight stay.",
